#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/3
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Got a content warning on this guy right here!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/11
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "If his name and habit didn't tip you off - Friar Errol is going to have some stories that touch on aspects of religion, with a particular emphasis on sin."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/19
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "If the thought of sitting in a church or temple fills you with angst, this one might not be for you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/27
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "You cool with that? Or you want to skip it?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's skip this please!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay with that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "No worries!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "How would you like your relationship with Friar Errol to resolve?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Love!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendship!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hate!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Friar Errol forever live in a heavenly embrace."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-0/27 friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-1/27 friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-2/27
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "See you out there on the next one!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The friendship between you and Friar Errol is crisp and oil-free."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You damn Friar Errol to eternal hatred."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-0/52/c-2/60 friar_airfryer/friar_hate_joiner/31
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Forgive me father, for I have grinned."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/skylar_friar_content/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Amen!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you walk into the kitchen you're overwhelmed by a strange feeling—it's sort of like being watched, but it's more than that... you feel as if you're being <i>evaluated</i>, scrutinized by a presence that isn't all that impressed by what it sees."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It doesn't take you long to pinpoint the source of that feeling: a cleric of some kind dressed in black and grey robes, with a coil of sorts atop his otherwise bald head."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He's handsome in a sterile and intimidating sort of way—but you can't even imagine this guy dating anyone. He's just so... severe."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/0 friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You reek."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, what?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you shine."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of what?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I heard you... what are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Spiritually."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, like... physically."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You gesture to his bald, shining head."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I don't have a clue what you mean, nor do I care."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "My physical appearance is of little consequence—it is only my soul that will ascend to The Heavenly Kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry the where?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-1/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He ignores you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/33/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You don't even see it, do you? Are you truly so far gone?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You reek of sin. And grease."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I feel as if I have been bathed in oil simply looking at you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But all I've had to eat today was cereal..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you always this aggressive with strangers?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you, some kind of health food zealot?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "This goes far beyond what you've eaten today, sinner."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Your soul is tainted from years of blasphemy."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Would it comfort you if I told you my name then?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Zealot? Hardly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am Friar Errol, founder of the First Church of Convection."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am the Steward of the Road to the Heavenly Kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am a Holy Vessel for Culinary Purity and Efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And I am your salvation, sinner... if you would but take my hand."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Hold his hand.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not taking shit of yours, bro."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What exactly do I need to do to achieve salvation?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You reach for his hand and take it in yours, looking him directly in the eye. He doesn't seem to know what to do at first, glaring at you in a surprised and uncomfortable silence."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eventually he extricates his hand from yours, wiping it on the front of his robes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-6/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I meant take my offer of help, wretch."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-6/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But it is not yet too late to save your soul."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How vulgar. You will keep a civil tongue in your head when you speak to a fryer of faith."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But My Lord of Convection is generous, even to those such as yourself. It is not too late to save your sorry soul."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is quite simple."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "First, you are to confess your sins to me, the steward of your culinary soul."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Second, you are to help spread the Gospel of Convection to any as yet unsaved."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And finally, you are to keep your soul pure and free of oils and impure heat."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The path to the Heavenly Kitchen is blessedly simple and attainable even for those as impure as you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Is Our Lord not Most Generous?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He sounds awful."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Praised be His Name!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm afraid... can you really save me?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You are so addled with sin and impurity you cannot even see when someone is offering you salvation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-9/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Calamity. Blasphemy. Treachery."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-9/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Bless your humble friar with patience, and strength, O Lord. I shall need it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes... yes, that's it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-10/21 friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Praise Him!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Be not afraid. There is no soul beyond My Lord's reach."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Simply do exactly as I tell you to, and you shall be saved."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Tell me—do you wish to repent for your culinary sins, here and now?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am ready, willing, and able to grant you absolution. You need only unburden yourself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bless me Friar, for I have food-sinned..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not ready yet but I'll take you up on it sometime."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're insane and I have nothing to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Do not delay too long—one never knows when their time is up."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/c-13/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I only pray you get your affairs in order before it is too late."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You are hardly the first to flinch from salvation, nor are you the first to sling such crude insults at your would-be savior."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/c-14/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Fortunately for you and your soul, I am made of sterner stuff."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/c-14/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am girded by the knowledge that I Am Right, and You Are Wrong."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-3/c-14/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And I will be here when you accept this and are ready to repent."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Go now. May the Lord of Convection turn his gaze upon you even as you continue to walk in shadow."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_intro/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar begins some sort of prayer, ignoring you as you wander away."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Speak, my child. What is it you wish to confess?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I had McDarnel's yesterday... the oil soaked right through the bag."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I once stole a pack of gum without realizing it from the grocery store..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't even know what air frying is or how it works."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A shudder runs through the friar—disgust, probably, but if you didn't know any better you'd almost swear he was kind of into hearing this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How disgusting... you've done the right thing confessing to me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Tell me... did you enjoy it? Did the impurity of it all titillate you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, it just disgusted me with myself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It did... I felt like I was getting away with a crime."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I loved every second and I'd do it again. I think I'll go get some right now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes, very good. You should feel ashamed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But do not despair. No longer will you be lost."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am here to guide you to salvation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "For today, 3 Hail Airys and one Our Father of Convection."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't know what that is..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/45/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/45/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have done well today, my child."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/45/g-0/8 friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/45
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Return to me again and we will continue guiding you down the path to salvation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/45/g-0/16 friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/53
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "For now, I must return to my duties."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-0/45/g-0/24 friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/61
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "May you feel His Currents at your back. Amen."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is insidious, is it not, the way the Grease Devil tempts us?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Even I am not immune to temptation, perfect though I may be."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The Grease Devil is slippery and sneaky indeed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-1/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But in confessing your temptation you have done well today, my child."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-2/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Devilry!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-2/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "To say such a thing so shamelessly in my presence!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-2/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You need more help than I ever could have imagined."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-2/40
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "When you come to your senses and decide to leave your sinning behind you, know that I will be here."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-2/48
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Arms outstretched, ready to save you from yourself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-0/40/c-2/56
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Leave me now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "That is... not the sort of sin the Church is concerned with."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I respect the devotion to purity, but Our Lord cares not about sins of property."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "If you do not have FOOD-related sin, specifically concerned with oil and improper cooking techniques, then I do not have any absolution to grant you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Please come back when you have something of that nature to confess."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have duties I must tend to for now, but I will be here when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Sweet Lord in His Heavenly Kitchen... you truly are in dire need of my help."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "There is much to teach you... I have duties I must tend to for now, but I will explain to you another time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Now go... and beware the temptations of the stove, oven, microwave, and toaster."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_confess1/0/c-2/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "False Methods all."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "After your last encounter, you're not entirely surprised to hear the Friar's voice before you enter the kitchen. You are, however, surprised by the volume and tone of his voice, as well as the presence of two others."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It seems there's a lively discussion going on when you enter."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "There is no reason to raise your voices. We can speak like civilized devices."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/27
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I SEE RIGHT THROUGH YOU, FATHER!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/41
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Friar."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/49
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Those who cannot handle progress and efficiency are doomed to oblivion and obscurity."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/57
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is perfectly natural to react to one's own obsolesence with anger."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/76
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You do your best to be quiet, but the moment your foot makes contact with the kitchen floor, three heads whip around to look at you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/84
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/92
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yes, you. Come here."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/100
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Adding another to your ranks will not help your cause."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/108
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "WILL YOU SHUT YER GODDAMN FRY-HOLE FOR JUST ONE SECOND?!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/119
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "We're obviously not going to settle this going around in circles like we've been, so you're just in time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/127/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "In time for what?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/128/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no... don't get me involved in this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/129/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree with whatever Friar Errol said."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have only tried to educate these two on the sorry state of their souls."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "'Only'... you-... you're insulting the culinary arts AND our entire existence."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "IT GETS ME REAL HEATED!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "What a shame. Don't let cowardice keep you from the path of Truth and Justice."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "THERE'S A RIGHT SIDE AND A WRONG SIDE, RANGER!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yeah, sometimes it's fine to get involved with other people's problems."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "DON'T TELL ME HE GOT TO YOU TOO, RANGER!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "We don't need anyone else spouting his convection drivel."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/c-2/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The Truth speaks for Itself, my lost little lambs."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Before you came, I was educating these two misguided souls as to the state of their spiritual affairs."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "For a time, Stefan's way was the only way we all knew."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Luke brought innovation in the form of eliminating oil, it's true, but his heat is unevenly applied, and if not wielded carefully can dry out and destroy most anything."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I AIN'T ABOUT TO LET YOU SPEAK FOR ME!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/38
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Or me!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/49
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Mmm. If you insist on spewing your lies, only do it quickly so we might return to the subject of Salvation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/57
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "GRRRR..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/65
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Deep breath, Luke. In and out. Trust me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/73
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Haa.... hooo... haaa... hooo..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/81
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Oh, there you are. Beautiful. Just like that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/89
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I'm gonna go first so I don't lose my goddamn cool and forget what I was gonna say."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/97
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Sure, buddy. Go ahead."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/105
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Look. Microwave's a real versatile tool."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/113
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Time was ya couldn't enjoy a meal without wastin' away over a hot stove."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/121
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "No offense, Stefan."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/129
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Some taken, but go on."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/137
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I REVOLUTIONIZED things! Housewives in the 70's could feed their families without so much hullabaloo!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/145
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I can handle ANYTHIN'! You want it you got it!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/153
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Bakin' a potato? I GOT IT! Boilin' water? I GOT THAT TOO!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/161
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Nukin' some dino nuggets or pizza rolls? I'M YOUR MICROWAVE!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/169/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Literally all the things you listed taste better in the oven though."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/170/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I gotta admit you've saved my bacon many times over the years when I was tired..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/171/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Except for boiling water the air fryer does all of that faster and cleaner."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "WHAT?!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Luke... take it easy."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "THAT WHAT YOU CALL THANKS AFTER ALL THE FOOD I'VE HEATED FOR YOU OVER THE YEARS!?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/40
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I may be unable to boil water, but I can prepare those things faster and ten times better."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Luke, calm down, and Friar, wait your turn. You'll have your say in a minute."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Yeah, see!? That's what the hell I'm talkin' about."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Hit a few buttons, beep beep beep, you're done!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "None of those high-falutin' recipes or tricky techniques!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Disgusting. You must want better for yourself from here on."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/45
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Speak for your goddamn self, Friar!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You see? There is no point in peddling your nefarious lies."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The truth will always emerge."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "YOU'RE the liar here, FRIAR!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Luke... come on. Don't let him make you go nuclear."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Look. I think we all know microwaves have their... uses."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Even I can admit that. Even if I... would never use one."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But there will never, NEVER be a replacement for the stove. <w>Ever.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Since the dawn of time, since man first learned to put flame to meat, there has always been a need for stoves, and there always will be."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "No matter what fancy gimmicks they come up with, there will NEVER be a replacement for the good old-fashioned heat of a stove, for the versatility of pans and utensils one can use with the stove."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Okay, so it takes a modicum of effort from the user."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So you'll have to do dishes after!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Is that all food has become to you? A series of inconveniences to be avoided?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Now who's gettin' heated..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "So it takes a little effort! It's always worth it, always!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not always worth it, actually."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The air fryer makes restaurant-quality food without effort though..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/85/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's true, the best meals of my life have been cooked on the stove..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are you serious?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Good food with integrity, with artistry, is ALWAYS worth it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Friar over there might be able to feed you fast, and maybe his food is crispier than Luke's..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/37
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "HEY!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/45
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But it has no SOUL!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/53
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I think you'll find that my food has the purest soul of all."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/61
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "That is NOT what I'm saying."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/69
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Food ain't got a soul!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/77
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Also... not what I'm saying..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "RESTAURANT-quality? Maybe if that restaurant is Burger Thing or Taco Spell... but even that would be a stretch."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Now now. There is no need to descend to such personal insults."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Simply accept that you are incorrect and obsolete."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/37
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Are you out of your goddamn mind?!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/48
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hardly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I had thought you knew better... and that you are used to something does not mean it is superior, or that it always must be the way forward."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "No, no. The stovetop is eternal. They can invent ten thousand cooking gimmick machines..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/29
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "But no one's ever gonna invent anything that can top the stove."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Enough. Against my better judgment I have allowed you both time enough to propagate your lies and blasphemies."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Now... it is my time to speak."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "Here we go."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Just give him a minute, Luke. He'll trip himself up."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "AHEM."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/46
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "There have been many culinary innovations over the history of mankind... innovations that allowed man to take great steps forward and truly progress."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/54
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The refrigerator... the food processor..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/62
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But the microwave failed to solve the problem of fat needed to make food crispy and evenly-heated."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/70
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The stove might be what mankind has known for years, but it requires both fat and needless effort to transform food."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/78
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But the power of convection eliminates the need for all these things."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/86
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And unlike a convection oven, an air fryer distributes air over a much smaller area, cooking food much faster."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/94
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Those dinosaur nuggets Mr. Nukem professes to make so well? I can make them better."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/102
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Pizza rolls? I have PERFECTED them."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/110
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "There is NOTHING those two can do that I cannot."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/118
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "DAMNED LIES!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/132
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Do you seriously believe this... this... bullshit!?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/143/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's all the truth."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/144/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe not EVERYTHING, but he is quite good."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/145/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely not."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Luke and Stefan groan in stereo, throwing up their hands and rolling their eyes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/27
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I AIN'T ABOUT TO STICK AROUND FOR THIS!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/35 friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/53
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Man, same. I'm out."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hardly the ringing endorsement of the truth I should have heard, but... it is a start."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Well... there might be some hope for you, but I'm not gonna argue you down."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/29
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "You wanna buff that fryer's ego that's your business."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/37
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "WE'RE DONE HERE!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/45
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Yeah, whatever. Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "HA! You tell 'im, Ranger!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Stefan"
msgid "Glad to see you've still got some sense."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The truth can be a difficult thing to accept, particularly when faced with temptation and blasphemy from all sides."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Still, I have faith you will see soon enough."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/45
msgctxt "Luke"
msgid "I ain't stickin' around to hear his little salespitch all over again."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The path of Righteousness and Truth is a lonely one, but I am used to walking it alone."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Still... you will all see. It may take some time, but I am confident."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Man strives for progress, efficiency, purity... sooner or later everyone will get on board, whether they like it or not."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem awfully confident."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree. They'll all see."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope they will."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "If you understood the beauty of Convection the way I do... its grace... its purity..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You too, would be confident."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-12/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I do not need anyone to take my side. What's right is right, even if I walk my path alone for now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Indeed they will. But I am glad you seem to understand."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is no small task to unchain your mind from the tendrils of Oil and Uneven Heat."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-13/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You are taking your first steps towards true freedom and bliss."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Indeed, but we must do more than hope."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I pray they will see reason sooner rather than later, but I know it is an inevitability."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Those two disrupted my ministry—if you'll excuse me, I must catch up on some things."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You will return, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do live here, so yeah."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dunno about that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "See you later, then."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/first_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The friar busies himself muttering a prayer under his breath, turning away from you and paging through what appears to be a manual of some kind."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You. I have been waiting for you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Never ask 'why'. Only ask 'how hot'."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "There is no need for either 'uh' nor 'oh'."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am working on outreach plans for the Church."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Every time I try to ask around the house about sinners in need of saving I am insulted, turned away, or even shunned."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And I am used to this, as preaching The Truth is a truly thankless job—but I cannot do my job without SOME modicum of help."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like a skill issue to me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What can I do to help you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How could they treat you so poorly? All you're doing is helping..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "'Skill issue'? No."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is simply a matter of obtaining the proper information."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I CAN and WILL do it over time without your help, but my time is valuable."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/37
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Simply tell me what I need to know here and now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is simple."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Most reject His message. They hate me because I tell them the truth."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I am used to this, and my work continues regardless."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But in order for me to do it, I must go where I am needed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Where might I do my best work?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Who is in most urgent need of my ministry?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The folks in the kitchen for sure. Luke and Stefan for a start."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nobody needs your lectures."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everyone. We'll just go down the line."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I cannot deny those two are in dire need of my help, but they are lost indeed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I would prefer to spend my time preaching to those who are more willing to listen at this point in time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "They are not <i>lectures</i>, and you couldn't be more incorrect."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "EVERYONE needs salvation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I would be a poor friar indeed if I turned my back on my flock now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I admire your ambition."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes... perhaps I will simply approach the task from room to room rather than on an individual basis."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hmm... there's still another thing I remain uncertain of."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "While His Message of Convection is perfect, I am not always perfect in my delivery."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Tell me... what would be the best way to reach those yet lost in the shadows of oil?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Air-fried food taste test!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I refuse to help you with this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Speaking to them a bit more nicely might help."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hmm... yes, that's it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "They may argue all day about principle, but they cannot deny the Truth of an Air-Fried French Fry in their mouths... warm, crispy... convenient..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes. Yes. Very good."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Why do you resist this? There is no reason to commit yourself to obsolescence and darkness."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Time and progress will go on without you—do not force yourself to stay behind."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I haven't the time or the interest in coddling others."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "As one who has known the Grace of Convection for years it is tiring continuously stooping down to the level of the uneducated. The great oil-soaked rabble. The microwaved hoi polloi."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "No, I will speak to them as they deserve to be spoken to."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I must return to my duties shortly, but before you go..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He hands you a pamphlet of some sort."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-3/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's this?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-3/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh god..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-3/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't really think-"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is a pamphlet with recipes for use with an air fryer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Scripture. If you do not wish to do the work it will do it for you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Merely leave these lying around the house in plain view... Curiosity will do the rest."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow that's brilliant."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seriously dude?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I am a little curious myself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Isn't it? Valdivian distributes these with every air fryer sold."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Magnificent, truly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes, yes. And do not ever address me as 'dude'."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am not 'Dude' Errol, I am Friar Errol."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes, you see? And once you pick it up and read it you will understand."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Go now... take the pamphlet with you. Study it. I shall have more for you later."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never agreed to this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-5/10/s/0 friar_airfryer/friar_taste_divert/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/second_encounter/0/g-6/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As per usual Friar Errol seems unconcerned with your response—he's gazing reverently at a pamphlet just like the one he gave you, lost in a spiritual silence."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you enter the kitchen you're surprised to hear organ music."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "Are you sure we can't try another track?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "AGAIN!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/27
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "...you got it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/35/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey starts the organ track from the beginning again, and Friar Errol hums along, half-muttering to himself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/38
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Thy Fans... Thy Grace... Thy Handle... Thy Interface..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/46
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "No, no, NO! Grease Devil take it all!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/54
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "It's not that serious, man..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/62
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is DEATHLY SERIOUS!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The friar pounds his fist on the table."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/78
msgctxt "Rainey"
msgid "I'm not sticking around for this. You can just sing it to yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/89/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Rainey hurries past you, giving you a pitying look as you approach the Friar."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/95
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I must get this right."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/103/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get what right?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/104/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on in here?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/105/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn you really upset her."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh... it's you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Work of the utmost importance."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Her upset is of little consequence to me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am composing a hymn to honor the Glory and Majesty of the Air Fryer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Music is, after all, one of the most universal languages."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But if I cannot perfect my hymn it is all for naught."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I need... I simply need to step out of my own mind. I am, perhaps, too close to the subject."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Tell me, how does this strike you for a title?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "In the Arms of the Convection Angels."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Too commercial. Not holy enough."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just right."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you can do better."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I see. Perhaps... Hark! The Air Fryer Beeps."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Much better."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hmm... yes, better indeed. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes, good. Excellent."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "'Better' is not helpful critique."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But since you are unable to provide me anything actionable, I must revisit it without you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Now then... for the chorus..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Should I extol the virtues of the fryer's purity? Its efficiency?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps both? Or should I mention its affordability..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All of the above. Don't leave anything out."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talk about its superiority."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should talk about how annoying it is to clean."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hmm, yes... I suppose there is room yet, if I compose creatively."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...yes. Yes, how could I forget?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Air fryers are superior in every way... and it covers all bases."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Affordability? Purity? Efficiency? Superior in every way."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "That is NOT a feature of air fryers, and I will thank you to keep such blasphemies to yourself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Disgusting and disrespectful."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will dignify that remark no longer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And finally, for the finale..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps I should light a candle...?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "No, too old-fashioned. Perhaps I will time it to incorporate the dignified beep of the fryer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Throw pizza rolls like confetti. Your audience will love it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Slam a microwave directly onto the kitchen floor. It'll be sick."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely the beep. The air fryer speaks for itself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is... undignified... but I suppose it has a certain appeal to the masses."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And it is they who must receive my message..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I shall consider it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How gauche. While it may deserve to be destroyed I will NEVER put my hands on such a tainted device."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I don't know why I bothered asking you. What a terrible suggestion."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes... yes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The grace of its beep... the flash of its most holy light..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes, the beeping must be our grand finale."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I've but one last thing to ask of you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Listen to this composition... and tell me how it strikes you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright-"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I don't want to-"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you sure you should be-"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The friar launches into his composition before you're even finished speaking, singing in a booming voice that makes you feel as though you cannot escape him or his message."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His focus is laser-sharp, and his dark eyes bore into yours as though he can see every impure thought in your head."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-3/c-14/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It makes you sweat just a little to have him looking at you so intensely, especially when he's singing like that. The whole thing is just a lot, frankly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And... fin."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Tell me... how did that make you feel?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like I'll never be happy again."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like you could see every sin I've ever committed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Inspired."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Well that is not the goal, so... I'm not sure whether I should be angry I've wasted my message on you..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Or if that means this hymn does indeed need tuning."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-15/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I shall have to pray on it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Good. The listener should feel terrified... and then inspired to run into the warm, loving arms of the Lord of Convection."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-16/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Good. Very good."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I had hoped more for terrified and touched, but that will do for now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-5/0/b/1
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Here. I trust you. Hold onto the hymnal for now. Let it inspire beauty."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-5/3
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I must track down Rainey at once—I need her backing, and she cannot hide from me forever."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-5/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I shall have to perform it for you once it is truly complete—but until then, may you walk in the Currents of Convection."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-5/19/s/0 friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Amen."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-5/20/s/0 friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-5/21/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/18/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/third_encounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar sets off at a fast march, walking right past you, singing under his breath as he goes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The last few times you've heard Friar Errol before you've seen him, but the Friar is unusually quiet today as you approach. It soon becomes clear why, as he's got his head down, reading something from a book."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The smell of something fried fills the room."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What've you got there?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How's it going, Friar?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Burn any good books lately?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "A treatise on air-fried chicken. It is... riveting."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "'It'? If 'it' is preaching the word of Our Lord of Convection, then it is going beautifully."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "We've not had any converts just yet, but I feel the tide is turning."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have not 'burned' anything."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Though I did throw out a recipe book for deep-fried appetizers I found on the shelf... ghastly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It occurs to me that perhaps I have been approaching this task incorrectly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You and I know that convection is the superior way to cook, but it seems that merely touting the superiority of a method of cooking is not enough."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Apparently sinners only grow more stubborn and more attached to their outdated old ways when faced with progress. Disgusting, really... but expected."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "So I have come up with a solution."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're going to finally give up on this whole preaching thing?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're going to do a taste test?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Didn't I already suggest that to you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're going to try a gentler approach?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I would be a poor friar indeed if I quit at the first sign of adversity. Besides, this is a matter of salvation and damnation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "One does not simply quit and leave one's lambs to the slaughter."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Indeed I am."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-0/c-6/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "One could say so."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have decided to allow the food to speak for itself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have procured potatoes from Food Fetch and prepared my own french fries."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Not a drop of oil within."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You need... a little oil..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How delightful."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/c-7/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh ye of little faith. Only have a bite and see."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/c-8/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You will find I do not. Open your mind and your stomach."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/tastejoin/c-9/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Isn't it? I should have started here."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol walks over to the counter, returning with a covered dish. He lifts the cover, revealing some very sad, very dry-looking potatoes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Behold... air-fried french fries. Not a drop of oil has touched them."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/22
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Beautiful, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're gorgeous."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're definitely fry-shaped."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They're hideous."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-10/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Thank you—all glory to Our Lord of Convection. Praise His Name."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-11/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "That was certainly my intent—I'm glad to see I've achieved this minimum goal."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-12/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Simply because they do not shine with grease does not mean they are not beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-1/c-12/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Expand your definitions of beauty."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar pushes the plate towards you, fixing you with his severe gaze."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You will be the first to taste them... to go forth and testify to the rest of the house."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He looks at you expectantly—you can't imagine these are going to be any good, but getting out of eating them feels like more trouble than it's worth."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take a bite—the potatoes are cooked, sure, but that's about as much as you can say for them."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol stares at you in stark silence, waiting for your reaction."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mmmm."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Transcendent."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trash."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-13/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Excellent. Just as I thought."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-14/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is truly a spiritual experience, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-14/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Such an even heat all around, with not a single drop of oil needed..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-14/29
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The ignorant rabble may insist oil is required to achieve the ideal roast, but I have proven them wrong."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-2/c-15/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How disappointing. Still, if you will not appreciate them, no doubt someone else will."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar covers the bowl again, pushing them off to the side."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will be taking these through the house with me, offering them to the lost souls I encounter."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Which, at last count... is everyone but you and I in this house."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't count me among your faithful, weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Those are steep odds..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sure they'll see the light."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-16/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "If you will not aid me in this endeavor then I've no use for you at this moment."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-16/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone. I will pray for you, but I can do nothing more for you right now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-17/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "They surely are, but I will prevail. The Truth always does."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-3/c-18/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I pray that they do, but they will. They must."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "When next we speak... I will have one last test of faith for you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Be sure to bring your appetite."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But until then, may you walk In His Currents."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fourth_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar returns to his readings, as serious and absorbed in them as ever."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_taste_divert/0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I don't know what you're talking about. This is my idea, and my idea alone."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/4
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The kitchen smells like something fried again, but the smell is much stronger today... and familiar in a strange way."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It smells like something deep fried... but surely that can't be right."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you encounter Friar Errol he looks almost manic—something is off with him. The lights are off, save for one stark light from the candelabra. It has a monastic, intimidating effect."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/28
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Ha... hahaha..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Just look at it. You can practically taste the oil."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar is concentrating on a single mozzarella stick on the table in front of him. It looks quite fresh."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh hey, mozzarella sticks."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friar, no!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm FINE! I've never been better!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm going to understand the secrets of this oil-soaked monstrosity and destroy it once and for all!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "'Oh hey, mozzarella sticks.'"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh to be so blind! To be so unaware!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-1/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The Grease Devil has speared you with his Oiled Pitchfork and you are so oblivious you cannot even SQUIRM!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Friar, yes! YES!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Don't you see? In order to destroy the Grease Devil I must first set foot in Hell."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But what am I saying... I know my own strength."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I know that <i>I</i> can handle temptation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But you... you have been coming to me and hearing my teachings all this time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have spoken to you at length of the Virtues of Convection."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Show me here and now that you have taken my teachings on board, that you have pulled back from the brink of Oily Oblivion."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol suddenly lifts the mozzarella stick and brings it to your lips, a wild look in his eye."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/fifth_encounter/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Now you will face true Temptation... resist!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/0 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol holds the mozzarella stick to your lips in a way that can only be described as threateningly erotic. He takes your chin in the other hand, his nostrils flaring, and his breath coming faster now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/11 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/8 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "RESIST!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/25 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/22 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It occurs to you that while you could just do what he's telling you to do, the tension in this moment is nigh-unbearable. It might be interesting to see what happens if you do something to break that tension..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/33/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/30/s/0 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Give in to temptation.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/34/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/31/s/0 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Stay strong.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/35/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Smash the mozzarella stick into his face and run.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not made of stone—this mozzarella stick is fresh and perfect, and when the Friar presses it to your lips it only takes a moment to make your decision."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You open your mouth, moaning as the fried delight hits your tongue. It's perfect in every way, crispy and golden, hot and thick."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol seems horrified by your reaction, but when he tries to pull the mozzarella stick away from you a long, thick string of cheese connects it to your lips, refusing to break no matter how long and hard he pulls."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/31 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/31 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He lets out a scream."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/39 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/39 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "DEVILRY! WRAP ME IN YOUR HEAVENLY WARMTH O FATHER OF PURITY!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His prayers have no impact on the never-ending cheese pull."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Break the cheese off yourself.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Invite him to eat the other end, like in that famous dog movie... </i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You bite the end of the cheese stick, and the Friar is so surprised the mozzarella stick nearly flies right out of his hand. He scrambles to catch it, before finally dropping it back onto the table."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/18
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You... I did not think you would actually succumb. And you did it right in front of me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/26
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have failed you... I led you right to temptation, and you gave in."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that really the worst thing you can think of?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, I was just confused..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Eternal Damnation?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Well yes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You are more than confused. You are adrift... and it was I who untethered you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I am ashamed. I have conducted myself in a manner most unbecoming of a mentor."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I am ashamed of you too. All the spiritual education and guidance I've given you, gone in a flash..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I had thought you spiritually stronger than that, but I see that I was wrong."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will spend the night on my knees in repentance... and if you've any care for your soul you will do the same."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But we must seek absolution apart. Go now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just like that?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Our Father of Convection, who art in Heavenly Kitchen..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He ignores you, kneeling on the kitchen floor and immersing himself in his prayers."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-0/37/g-0/c-2/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/63/g-0/19 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-1/19 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/55/g-0/19 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/50/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/50/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/50/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/34/c-0/23/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/47/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/c-1/31 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/c-1/31 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/34/c-0/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can hear the friar's fervent prayers echoing through the house after you as you walk away. It seems quite clear that whatever sort of relationship you and the Friar had is likely over now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take his hand in yours, lifting the other end of the mozzarella stick to his lips."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes a moment for him to realize what you're suggesting, but beyond the conflict in his gaze is something undeniable..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "<i>Desire.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's tangible, an unseen force so strong it's smothering."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes... yes, of course..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/47
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How could I understand... if I don't experience it for myself..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/55
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It <i>has</i> to be this way..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/63
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He takes a bite, and the sound that escapes him is ten kinds of wrong, what must be decades of repression leaving his body in one lewd groan."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/71
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Divine!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/82
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're now connected by a single thick, gooey strand of cheese that grows shorter by the moment, your faces coming closer as you both move instinctively."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/90
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A moment's hesitation, and then the Friar moves first, pressing his lips to yours in a mozzarella-flavored kiss that's less tender and more forceful, a declaration of his intent to conquer you as surely as he did the temptation that's broken him."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/112
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you finally part, the friar presses his fingertips to his lips, his cheeks flushed and his eyelids low and hooded."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/120
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "That was... I must... pray."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't run away from this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was a mistake."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we could just talk about it instead?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...you are right. I must face this head on."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I should be horrified at what I've done... what we've done..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I feel reborn, somehow."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Am I losing my mind? Shouldn't I feel as if I've sinned?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If that's what you think then maybe you and I shouldn't do this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's between you and your lord."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A kiss and a mozzarella stick aren't gonna kill you, dude."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...that easily?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Ah. I see now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/31 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You... you seduced me. I was weak in the face of your wiles."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/31 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/39 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You forced this upon me... the Grease Devil whispered in your ear and curled your sinful finger, beckoning to me..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/39 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/47 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And Lord help me I fell, screaming into the dark abyss."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/47 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/55 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But never again. I will not allow you to drag me down with you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/55 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/63 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/47
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone, sinner. Do not darken this kitchen again."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/63/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/71/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I LIVE here, bro."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/63/1/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/71/1/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine by me, freak."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/63/g-0/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-1/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/55/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I WILL HEAR NO MORE! YOU WILL LEAD ME INTO SIN NO LONGER!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-0/63/g-0/11 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-1/11 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/55/g-0/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "YEA THOUGH I WALK THROUGH THE VALLEY OF THE SHADOW OF GREASE I WILL FEAR NO OIL, FOR THOU ART WITH ME; THY FANS AND THY CURRENTS, THEY WARM ME-"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I... suppose it is."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...I have taken no vows of chastity, it's true..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But the combination of these two temptations is powerful indeed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How am I to know whether I am compromised if I do not keep my mind and body pure?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Life isn't about being pure and unstained. Sometimes you gotta live a little."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you don't know. The point is in the trying, right?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps you are right... I have lived a harsh life of little comfort."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps with you by my side... I could indeed live a little."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just be friends, please."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-2/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "As would I."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "In that case... call me Errol, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "In the arms of my beloved I am a Friar no longer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-2/34/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/50/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Errol..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-2/34/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/50/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It sounds like the sweetest prayer from your lips. I am truly blessed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh, well... I can accept that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have so enjoyed our talks... if we can continue this I'll be happy indeed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll always have a friend in me, Friar."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Errol, please. Just Errol will do."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Errol, then."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/15/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/15/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Thank you, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/15/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/15/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm afraid I must clean up here... and think long and hard about what it is I intend to do with my ministry going forward."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/15/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/15/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I hope you'll stop by for a chat later."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-3/23/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/23/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Wonderful. Until then, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "What? After all that?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How could I..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-0/39/g-0/8/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh. I see now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It was more than a mistake. It was <i>blasphemy</i>."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...I suppose nothing will prepare me to confront what I've done."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "All this time we've been talking about faith and spirituality, and I thought I was reaching you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-2/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But somewhere along the way this became about my fear of losing you to the other side."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/c-2/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And now... I've lost myself too."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't faith supposed to be about forgiveness too? I'm not the expert, but..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're way too hard on yourself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Well... yes, perhaps..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I... suppose I have been a bit focused on fat and brimstone and less so on the beauty of forgiveness... of being reborn in the Lord of Convection's Heavenly Currents..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if maybe you just calmed down a little and just respected everyone else's way of living?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...who will guide the lost if not I?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If air frying is for them they'll find their way to it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...I suppose its truth and beauty is an inevitability..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps I could focus my ministry on those who truly wish to be here."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But in that case... what of you and I?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You and I?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Our friendship?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There is no you and I."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes. I... I have enjoyed our talks, even if I do not show it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have grown used to your presence. Perhaps a great deal more than used to."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "If you would be open to it... I would like to..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "C-c-continue seeing you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want to be friends."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks, I've had enough of all this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Well. In that case."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/31 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But one last thing... call me Errol, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-0/39 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "In the arms of my beloved, I am a Friar no longer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh, well... that would be wonderful too."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...after all that, nothing?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/18 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/18 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/18 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/26 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/26 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/26
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You shatter my world and then wash your hands of me? I understand now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/34 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/34 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/34 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/34/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/31 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/34/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh the Devil is Oily and Slippery indeed! I knew better, and still... I allowed myself to be tempted!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/42 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/42 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/42 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/34/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/39 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/34/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone, betrayer! I must purify myself..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-0/39/c-2/50/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-3/50/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-2/50/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/34/c-0/23/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/47/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/34/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I... I had hoped for more. But if friendship is all you want..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want more."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It is."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't even want that with you man."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Then you shall have it, sweet one. But for now..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-0/58/c-1/128/g-0/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/31/c-1/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh, well... friendship would be just as lovely."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You keep your mouth firmly shut, turning your face away from the mozzarella stick and closing your eyes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/15 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "After a few moments, Friar Errol releases you with a shaky sort of laugh."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/26 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Ha... hahaha! You did it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/37 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "My teachings have reached you after all... I have saved your soul."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/45 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/42 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He drops the mozzarella stick onto the table, as though it were made of hot lead."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/53 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/50
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "That was... intense, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/61 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/58
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Still, you have done it. You looked the Devil directly in his oily eye and spat in it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/69 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/66
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have earned my eternal respect... and friendship, if you'll have it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/1/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only friendship?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/2/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping for more."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "After all that, nothing?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You showed such great promise, and yet still you'd rather return to the Devil himself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-0/34/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That is not what I said-"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm... sorry to hear that. It would be unethical for me as your mentor and spiritual guide to cross that boundary in our relationship."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm afraid all I can offer you is friendship."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks, then."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-1/77/g-0/16/1/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendship it is, then."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-2/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You smash the mozzarella stick into his face, somewhere along his mouth and nose, and flee for your life."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-2/18 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "YOu can hear the sound of something crashing to the ground behind you, but you don't bother looking back."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-2/37 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-2/34
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "YOU CANNOT LEAVE NOW! STOP!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-2/48 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-2/42
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "DO NOT TURN YOUR BACK ON ME!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/love_temptation/0/c-2/56 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-2/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "This is officially too much for you—you ignore his increasingly furious cries as you disappear from the kitchen. It seems quite clear that whatever sort of relationship you and the Friar had is likely over now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not made of stone—this mozzarella stick is fresh and perfect, and when the Friar presses it to your lips it only takes you a moment to make your decision."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/50 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His prayers have no impact on the never-ending cheese pull. In desperation, he tosses the mozzarella stick away from him—it finally snaps at some point, sending the mozzarella stick tumbling to the floor with a dull little thud."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/61 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/61
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar backs away from you, watching in horror as the rest of the long string of cheese disappears into your mouth. Perhaps this was the wrong way to handle this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/69 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/69
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He points at you with a shaking hand."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/77
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You... you have not heard a single word I've said, have you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/85
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You acted as though you were listening... as though you understood..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/93 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/93
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And now, here, in what would have been your moment of ascension to the ranks of the Most Pure, you have failed yourself, and more importantly, Our Father."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/101 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/101
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I could pray over your soul all night, but what would be the point?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/109
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "To walk so willingly, so ENTHUSIASTICALLY into sin... we are simply cut from a different cloth."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's not very friarly of you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We are different, yeah. I'm awesome and you suck."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/2/s/0 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really won't give me a chance to redeem myself?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "What would you know of friarly behavior? The condemnation of such an advanced sinner means nothing to me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will pray for you... but this is the end."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/26
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone from my presence, O Agent of Grease. We have nothing more to discuss."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-0/31/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-0/31/1/s/0 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It didn't have to be like this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And yet, it is. Meditate on that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "How childish. There truly is nothing left for us to discuss."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will pray for you, futile though it may be."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/1/s/0 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Keep your prayers."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/c-1/7 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hateful. You are so compromised you cannot even see it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/c-1/15 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "O Father of Convection, turn your fans upon this lost soul..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-1/23/c-1/23 friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Let no oil soak their eternal spirit..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You were given a chance to prove yourself and you failed."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Anything you do now will be hollow, empty."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have betrayed me, yourself, and Our Lord. All I can do is pray for you now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-0/117/c-2/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Futile though it may be... I can manage that much for you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-0/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "To think I might have a true friend in you!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm... sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It would be unethical for me as your mentor and spiritual guide to cross that boundary in our relationship."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-1/74/g-0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I'm afraid that is all I can offer to you at this time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friend_temptation/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can hear the sound of something crashing to the ground behind you, but you don't bother looking back."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/77
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You... you are the Grease Devil themself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/85
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I had thought a final test would shake you from your gleeful sin..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/109
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I knew you were a lost cause. I KNEW. But I had prayed otherwise..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/117
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I walked right into this catastrophe."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Giving up on me isn't very friarly of you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really did play yourself. I bet you feel stupid."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "What would you know of friarly behavior, wretch? The condemnation of such an advanced sinner means nothing to me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/18
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will not waste my prayers on you, fiend."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/34/c-0/7 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/34/c-1/26 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-1/23 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/c-0/15 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/c-1/31 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/c-0/23 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/c-1/23 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-0/18 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/18 friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/55
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Perhaps more damning than the Friar's condemnations is the pointed silence that follows as you leave. There are no prayers, no plans for saving your soul. It's clear whatever sort of relationship was building between you and the Friar is well and truly over now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And yet, it is. You have chosen this."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-0/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I say again, begone! I have nothing more for you!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Take yourself from my sight."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I knew you were a lost cause from the start. This <i>was</i> your chance to redeem yourself."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You failed, and you failed gleefully, enthusiastically."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Anything you do now will be meaningless."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have betrayed me, yourself, and Our Lord. Normally I'd pray for you, but I do not see any point."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems harsh."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never wanted your prayers in the first place!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "So is Hell. Begone, wretch."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It is just as well you have no desire for salvation, for I cannot grant it to you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-0/125/c-2/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Go. I will suffer your presence no longer, blasphemer."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Ha... hahaha! I did it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "My teachings have reached you after all..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/50
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have achieved a victory in the battle for your soul..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/58
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "If only it were enough."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean that's not enough?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bro I just didn't want you to feed me."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing's good enough for you is it?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have denied my teachings at every turn."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Resisting this temptation was the BARE MINIMUM."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You think doing the right thing ONCE will help you ascend the stairway to the Heavenly Kitchen?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "HA! HAHAHAHAHA!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You are so far underwater in the ocean of sin you cannot see Heaven's light!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/47
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Congratulations on doing one good thing once. You have shown me that there is a tiny atom of hope even for someone like you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/55
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I will not waste my time or my breath trying to educate you any further."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/63
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have rejected the Truth 99% of the time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/71
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will not waste my efforts hoping for another incident like today."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That isn't fair."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I never asked you to, so..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Life often is not."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone with you. I've nothing left to say."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "No one asks a Friar to do his duties. He undertakes them knowing he will be hated, and not thanked once."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-0/79/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But never again will I take up those duties with you. Leave me now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You cannot even pretend to want to do the right thing, can you? You are truly lost."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will waste no more time in your tainted presence, wretch."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was leaving anyway."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I'll go get some nuggets..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Then HURRY UP ABOUT IT!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have no shame, do you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You walk willingly into the Grease Devil's arms, and he embraces you like an old lover."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I truly pity you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I pity YOU, freako. I'm having a great time."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-1/31/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "ENOUGH! BEGONE FROM MY KITCHEN!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Nothing with that disgusting attitude, yes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You have conditioned me to expect nothing from you, and even still I am continually let down."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "So you did the right thing ONCE today. It is meaningless in the grand scheme."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps you may find your way to the path of Righteousness and Purity on your own."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "A true miracle in that case—but it will not be by my hand. I refuse to waste anymore time on you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/hate_temptation/0/c-1/66/c-2/47
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Go now. May the Lord have mercy on your greasy soul."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/8/s/0 friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi Errol."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0 friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How goes the ministry?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you show me some of your favorite works from on high?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The work is just as fraught as ever, I'm afraid..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't seem too down about it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Indeed. Having your support has bolstered my spirits greatly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps I will reach the others in time..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I remain grateful for your friendship and support."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But if you wouldn't mind taking a few of these pamphlets with you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you later, Errol."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Another time, then."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_friendship_return/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol smiles warmly, and he shows you 50 or 60 of his favorite lessons. You leave feeling lighter, though, not burdened. Almost as if His Currents are at your back."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Oh blessed day, my beloved walks smiling into my kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hello, love."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What're you working on?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shall we recite?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I was just reviewing these severely outdated outreach materials, but there's no need to concern yourself with such things."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I only want to know what you're doing."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a lot better seeing you look so happy."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Then I will spend the rest of my days with a smile on my face."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've got to run for now, but I'll see you again soon?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I will count the minutes, my darling."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-1/23/c-0/15/c-0/18 friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "May you walk in His Currents."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_return/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The friar smiles warmly, and the two of you recite scriptures together, blessings be on high."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol is hunched over a letter when you enter the kitchen. When your eyes meet he glares at you, his pen continuing to scratch against the paper all the while."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "What do you want, wretch?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Begone lest I exorcise you myself, demon of grease and temptation."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please, Friar. I've done a lot of thinking and praying and I want to start again. (USE SMARTS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You would not believe the indignities I must endure here, Your Holiness."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Every day is a nightmare, and my words continue to fall on grease-plugged ears... do hasten to us soon, Your Eminence..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I have prayed for a miracle, you know."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Perhaps the Lord has answered my prayers after all."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Let us start again then, as friends."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "And perhaps... perhaps my title has created too much distance between us."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/47
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You may call me Errol."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you, Errol. I'm happy we can start again."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_hate_return/0/c-1/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "As am I. Go in peace and purity, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...truly? You understand what this means, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, and I'm ready to do it."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_join/0/18/s/0 friar_airfryer/friar_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Realization is not to be undertaken lightly."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Do not return until you are truly ready."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Have you considered it? Are you truly prepared to Realize me?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'm ready now."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "...very well. Please take this seriously."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Return when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "For our first dateable Realized, I can't imagine anyone sterner... I hope this works..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Friar Errol - let's go to church!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely an air fryer, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol somehow only grows more severe as a human, the air of intimidation that emanates from him like so much hot air overwhelming you."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes... yeeeesss..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/22
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "The power of this body...!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/30
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Nothing will stop me from delivering His message now!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Huh. I kinda thought you'd forget about that stuff once you were human..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't you wanna praise me, Errol baby?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Forget? No. Now I have a body fit to execute His Will here on earth!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Now I can truly walk In His Currents! Don't you see?"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, uh, sure. Well... good luck."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "I need no luck—only blessings."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "But I thank you for your well-wishes."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_realized/0/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Your service to the Church shall not be forgotten, mark my words."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Friar pauses in his manic scheming for just a moment, giving you an intense, evaluating look."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "All praise is His and His alone. However..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "It would behoove me to learn just what this body is capable of."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/35
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "To better know the tool at my disposal..."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/43
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes. Come and aid me in this, my dearest associate."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol is just as exacting a lover as you'd expect; he relishes in giving orders, demanding you worship on your knees until you've both seen heaven."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But Friar Errol is ever himself—even with the taste of your worldly delights on his tongue, the friar refuses to change his tune."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_divert/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There is no cuddling or sweet talk afterwards—he thanks you for your service and leaves, the only true sign of his satisfaction the hymn he hums under his breath."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Friar Errol finds work at a members-only Wholesale store, PriceCo, famed for their excellent deals."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He was hired on as a cashier, but quickly bullied his way into handing out food samples where he could truly speak to customers at length about—you guessed it—the gospel of air fryers."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/16
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You there! Come here."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/24
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Yes, you, the slack-jawed, oil-soaked yokel."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/32
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "You may be familiar with Mama Mary's Pizza Pockets, but have you ever had one made in the air fryer? It is a transcendent experience."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/40
msgctxt "Friar Errol"
msgid "Where are you going? Return at once and experience glory, coward!"
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For as many customers as Errol annoys, even more walk out of the store with a brand new air fryer. Management has decided it's a wash and looks the other way."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/59
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Errol seems happy enough, but nothing is ever quite enough for him."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He sends you regular letters updating you on his and the church's activities—each letter includes an air fryer recipe of his own."
msgstr ""

#: friar_airfryer/friar_love_join/75
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Truthfully... they're not bad."
msgstr ""
